        "routeSummary": "with Lachung",
        "overviewText": "This **8 Days 7 Nights Sikkim Darjeeling tour with Lachung** is a **well-balanced Himalayan journey**, combining [Darjeeling](https://indiatour.live/attractions/darjeeling), Gangtok, and North Sikkim in one seamless itinerary.\n\nYour trip begins in Darjeeling, where you ease into the mountains with tea gardens, colonial charm, and the iconic [Tiger Hill](https://indiatour.live/attractions/tiger-hill) sunrise, offering stunning views of **Kanchenjunga** along with visits to key attractions around the town.\n\nFrom Darjeeling, you travel to [Gangtok](https://indiatour.live/attractions/gangtok), where the vibe becomes more lively with local culture, cafés, and scenic viewpoints. A key highlight here is the excursion to **[Tsomgo Lake](https://indiatour.live/attractions/tsomgo-lake)** and Baba Mandir, adding a memorable high-altitude experience to your journey.\n\nThe trip then takes you deeper into [North Sikkim](https://indiatour.live/tours/north-sikkim-tour-package) as you travel to Lachung, where the landscapes become more raw and untouched. The excursion to [Yumthang Valley](https://indiatour.live/attractions/yumthang-valley) offers breathtaking views of wide-open valleys, seasonal blooms, and pristine Himalayan beauty before returning to Gangtok.\n\nOverall, this [Sikkim Darjeeling Lachung itinerary](https://indiatour.live/tours/best-of-sikkim-darjeeling-with-kalimpong) is perfect for travelers who want to **experience both iconic highlights and offbeat landscapes**, all at a comfortable and well-paced rhythm.\n\n### **Highlights of Sikkim Darjeeling Trip**\n\n#### 🌄 Darjeeling\n#### \nDarjeeling sightseeing includes the iconic Tiger Hill sunrise, where you can witness **Kanchenjunga** in golden light.\n\nYou’ll visit the Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park, and [Tenzing Rock](https://indiatour.live/attractions/tenzing-rock-hmi), along with enjoying panoramic views from the [Darjeeling Ropeway](https://indiatour.live/attractions/darjeeling-ropeway). The experience also includes the Tibetan Refugee Self-Help Centre, Japanese Temple, Peace Pagoda, and scenic views of the tea gardens, with evenings free at Chowrasta and Mall Road.\n\n#### 🌆 Gangtok\n#### \nIn Gangtok, you’ll explore MG Marg, the lively hub of the city known for cafés and local shopping.\n\nThe highlight of your Gangtok sightseeing is the excursion to **[Tsomgo Lake](https://indiatour.live/attractions/tsomgo-lake)**, a beautiful high-altitude lake surrounded by mountains, followed by a visit to Baba Mandir, a revered spiritual site.\n\n\n#### 🏔️ North Sikkim (Lachung)\n#### \nAs you head towards Lachung, the journey itself becomes a highlight. En route, you’ll visit Naga Waterfall, [Bhim Nala Waterfall](https://indiatour.live/attractions/bhim-nala-waterfall), and the scenic confluence of [Lachen Chu](https://indiatour.live/attractions/lachen) and Lachung Chu rivers at Chungthang—offering raw Himalayan landscapes.\n\n#### 🌸 Yumthang Valley\n#### \nThe highlight of North Sikkim is the visit to [Yumthang Valley](https://indiatour.live/attractions/yumthang-valley), known as the “Valley of Flowers,” with vast meadows, grazing yaks, and stunning mountain views.\n\nOn your return, you’ll stop at the natural Hot Springs, known for their sulfur-rich waters and therapeutic properties, followed by time to relax and explore Lachung village at your own pace.\n\n**Book Your [Sikkim Darjeeling Lachung](https://indiatour.live/tours/sikkim-darjeeling-tour-package) Trip Now.**\n\n### Why Choose This Sikkim Darjeeling Lachung Package\n\n- Covers **Darjeeling, Gangtok, and [North Sikkim](https://indiatour.live/tours/north-sikkim-tour-package)** in one trip.\n- Perfect balance of **comfort travel and offbeat experiences**.\n- Includes **Lachung and [Yumthang Valley](https://indiatour.live/attractions/yumthang-valley)**, adding a unique element to the trip.\n- Ideal for travelers looking for a **slightly adventurous yet comfortable itinerary**.\n- Multiple stay options available from Basic to Luxury.\n- Private tour ensures flexibility and a smooth travel experience.\n\n### Important Travel Tips for Sikkim Darjeeling Trip\n\n- Carry **warm clothes**, especially for Lachung and Yumthang Valley.\n- Keep valid ID proof handy for permits and hotel check-ins.\n- Start early for North Sikkim travel days due to long routes.\n- Carry cash for remote areas with limited ATM access.\n- Stay hydrated and take it slow at higher altitudes.\n- Follow local guidelines in eco-sensitive regions like North Sikkim.\n\n**Want a Customized [Sikkim Trip](https://indiatour.live/tours/sikkim-darjeeling-tour-package) Instead.**\n\n👉 **Talk to our travel expert and plan your [Sikkim trip](https://indiatour.live/tours/sikkim-tour-package/enquiry) exactly the way you want.**",
