        "routeSummary": "with Gangtok and Pelling",
        "overviewText": "This **6 Days 5 Nights Sikkim tour package with [Gangtok](https://indiatour.live/attractions/gangtok) and [Pelling](https://indiatour.live/attractions/pelling)** is a **well-paced Himalayan getaway**, perfect for travelers who want to explore without feeling rushed.\n\nYour journey begins with a scenic transfer from Siliguri to Gangtok, where you settle into the mountains and take time to explore the city. A key highlight of your Gangtok experience is the excursion to **[Tsomgo Lake](https://indiatour.live/attractions/tsomgo-lake)** and [Baba Mandir,](https://indiatour.live/attractions/baba-harbhajan-singh-temple) followed by a full day of sightseeing covering viewpoints, cultural spots, and local experiences.\n\nFrom Gangtok, the journey continues to Pelling via Namchi, adding a scenic and cultural touch along the way. In Pelling, you explore a mix of monasteries, waterfalls, and panoramic viewpoints, including the Skywalk, all set against breathtaking views of **Kanchenjunga**.\n\nOverall, this [Gangtok Pelling itinerary](https://indiatour.live/tours/darjeeling-pelling-gangtok-tour-package) is ideal for those who want to **enjoy the mountains at a relaxed pace**, with a perfect balance of sightseeing, scenic drives, and peaceful landscapes.\n\n### **Sikkim Tour Package** Highlights\n\n#### 🌆 Gangtok\n#### \nIn Gangtok, you’ll experience a mix of city life, viewpoints, and cultural attractions. Spend time at MG Marg, the lively heart of the city known for cafés and local shopping.\n\nYour Gangtok sightseeing includes an excursion to **Tsomgo Lake**, a beautiful high-altitude lake, followed by a visit to [Baba Mandir](https://indiatour.live/attractions/baba-harbhajan-singh-temple).\n\nYou’ll also explore key viewpoints like Tashi Viewpoint (with views of **Kanchenjunga**), Ganesh Tok, and Hanuman Tok. Cultural stops include the Cottage Industry Centre, Namgyal Institute of Tibetology, Do-drul Chorten, and Gonjang Monastery, along with a visit to [Ban-Jhakri Falls](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ban-jhakri-falls-park).\n\n#### 🏔️ Pelling\n#### \nYour journey to Pelling includes a scenic drive via Namchi, where you’ll visit Siddheshwar Dham (Char Dham complex) and Sai Temple.\n\nPelling sightseeing covers [Darap Village](https://indiatour.live/attractions/darap-village), Rimbi Waterfalls, [Khecheopalri Lake](https://indiatour.live/attractions/khecheopalri-lake), and Khangchendzonga Waterfalls, offering a blend of nature and local culture.\n\nYou’ll also explore Pemayangtse Monastery and Rabdantse Ruins, along with panoramic viewpoints like the Skywalk and Helipad Ground, all set against stunning Himalayan landscapes.\n\nEvenings are kept relaxed, giving you time to unwind or explore Pelling at your own pace.\n\n**[Book Your Sikkim Trip Now](https://indiatour.live/tours/sikkim-tour-package/enquiry).**\n\n### Why Choose This Sikkim Package\n\n- Focuses on **Sikkim only**, without adding multiple destinations.\n- Offers a **more relaxed and immersive experience**.\n- Includes both **Gangtok and Pelling**, covering key highlights.\n- Ideal for travelers looking for a **peaceful and non-hectic itinerary**.\n- Perfect for **couples, families, and slow travelers**.\n- Private tour ensures flexibility and comfort.\n\n### Important Travel Tips for Sikkim Trip\n\n- Carry **warm clothes in all seasons**, especially for mornings and evenings.\n- Keep valid ID proof handy for permits and hotel check-ins.\n- Start early for sightseeing to make the most of clear weather.\n- Carry cash for smaller towns and local shops.\n- Stay hydrated and maintain a comfortable travel pace.\n- Keep buffer time for weather-related changes.\n\n**Want a Customized [Sikkim Trip](https://indiatour.live/tours/sikkim-darjeeling-tour-package) Instead.**\n\n👉 **Talk to our travel expert and plan your [Sikkim trip](https://indiatour.live/tours/sikkim-tour-package/enquiry) exactly the way you want.**",
