      "routeSummary": "with Gangtok and Darjeeling",
      "overviewText": "This **5 Days 4 Nights Sikkim Darjeeling tour package** is a **perfect short Himalayan getaway**, covering [Gangtok](https://indiatour.live/attractions/gangtok) and [Darjeeling](https://indiatour.live/attractions/darjeeling) in a smooth, well-paced itinerary.\n\nYour journey starts from Siliguri with a scenic drive to Gangtok, where you’ll experience some of the top places to visit in Sikkim, including an excursion to the stunning **[Tsomgo Lake](https://indiatour.live/attractions/tsomgo-lake)** and Baba Mandir—one of the most memorable high-altitude experiences in this Gangtok Darjeeling trip.\n\nThe itinerary then continues to Darjeeling, where the vibe shifts to tea gardens, misty landscapes, and classic hill station charm. As part of your Darjeeling sightseeing, you’ll witness the iconic Tiger Hill sunrise with views of **Kanchenjunga**, along with other popular attractions.\n\nOverall, this Sikkim Darjeeling itinerary is ideal for travelers looking for a **quick yet fulfilling mountain trip**, blending scenic drives, key attractions, and a relaxed travel pace.\n\n\n### **Best of Sikkim** Trip Highlights\n\n#### 🌆 Gangtok\n#### \nIn Gangtok, you’ll experience a mix of local culture and high-altitude beauty. Spend time exploring MG Marg, the city’s lively hub filled with cafés, shops, and a relaxed vibe.\n\nThe highlight of your Gangtok sightseeing is the excursion to **Tsomgo Lake**, a stunning glacial lake surrounded by mountains. The journey continues to [Baba Mandir](https://indiatour.live/attractions/baba-harbhajan-singh-temple), dedicated to Baba Harbhajan Singh, adding a unique and spiritual touch to the experience.\n\n#### 🌄 Darjeeling\n#### \nDarjeeling blends iconic viewpoints, nature, and cultural experiences. Start your day early with the famous Tiger Hill sunrise, where you can witness **Kanchenjunga** glowing in the morning light.\n\nYour Darjeeling sightseeing includes the Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park, and [Tenzing Rock](https://indiatour.live/attractions/tenzing-rock-hmi). Enjoy panoramic views from the Darjeeling Ropeway, visit the Tibetan Refugee Self-Help Centre, and soak in the beauty of the tea gardens.\n\nYou’ll also visit the peaceful Japanese Temple and Peace Pagoda, with evenings free to explore [Chowrasta](https://indiatour.live/attractions/mall-road-darjeeling) and Mall Road at your own pace.\n\n**Book Your [Sikkim Darjeeling Trip Now](https://indiatour.live/tours/sikkim-darjeeling-tour-package).**\n\n### Why Choose This Sikkim Darjeeling Package\n\n- Perfect for a **short and quick Himalayan getaway**.\n- Covers the most important highlights of **Sikkim and Darjeeling**.\n- Ideal for **couples, families, and first-time travelers**.\n- Well-paced itinerary without long travel fatigue.\n- Multiple stay options available from Basic to Luxury.\n- Private tour ensures comfort and flexibility.\n\n\n### Important Travel Tips for Sikkim Darjeeling Trip\n\n- Carry **warm clothes in all seasons**, especially for mornings and evenings.\n- Keep valid ID proof handy for permits and hotel check-ins.\n- Start early for sightseeing to avoid weather disruptions.\n- Carry some cash for areas with limited ATM access.\n- Stay hydrated and avoid rushing in high-altitude areas.\n- Pre-book experiences like [Nathula Pass](https://indiatour.live/attractions/nathula-pass) if you plan to include it.\n\n**Want a Customized [Sikkim Trip](https://indiatour.live/tours/best-of-sikkim-darjeeling-with-kalimpong) Instead.**\n\n👉 **[Talk to our travel expert here](https://indiatour.live/tours/sikkim-tour-package/enquiry) and plan your trip exactly the way you want.**",
