      "overviewText": "This **6 Days 5 Nights Gangtok Darjeeling tour package** is a **well-balanced Himalayan getaway**, offering enough time to explore both destinations at a comfortable pace.\n\nYour journey begins with a scenic transfer from Siliguri to [Gangtok](https://indiatour.live/attractions/gangtok), where you settle into the mountains before heading out for an excursion to **Tsomgo Lake** and [Baba Mandir](https://indiatour.live/attractions/baba-harbhajan-singh-temple)—one of the most memorable high-altitude experiences in Sikkim. An additional day in Gangtok allows you to explore the city more deeply, covering key viewpoints, cultural spots, and local experiences.\n\nFrom Gangtok, the trip continues to Darjeeling, where the landscape shifts to tea gardens and classic hill station charm. Your Darjeeling sightseeing includes the iconic [Tiger Hill](https://indiatour.live/attractions/tiger-hill) sunrise, offering breathtaking views of **Kanchenjunga**, along with visits to popular attractions around the town.\n\nOverall, this [Gangtok Darjeeling itinerary](https://indiatour.live/tours/darjeeling-pelling-gangtok-tour-package) is perfect for travelers looking for a **relaxed yet complete mountain experience**, combining scenic drives, iconic highlights, and a well-paced journey.\n\n### **Gangtok Darjeeling Tour Package** Highlights\n\n#### 🌆 Gangtok\n#### \nIn Gangtok, you’ll explore a mix of city highlights, cultural sites, and high-altitude experiences. Spend time at MG Marg, the lively heart of the city, before heading out for an excursion to **Tsomgo Lake**, a scenic glacial lake surrounded by mountains. The journey continues to Baba Mandir, a revered site dedicated to Baba Harbhajan Singh.\n\nYour [Gangtok](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ganesh-tok) sightseeing also includes Tashi Viewpoint with views of **Kanchenjunga**, along with Ganesh Tok and Hanuman Tok. You’ll visit cultural attractions like the Cottage Industry and Handicraft Centre, Namgyal Institute of Tibetology, [Do-drul Chorten](https://indiatour.live/attractions/do-drul-chorten), and Gonjang Monastery. The experience is completed with a visit to[Ban-Jhakri Falls](https://indiatour.live/attractions/ban-jhakri-falls-park), adding a refreshing natural touch.\n\n#### 🌄 Darjeeling\n#### \nDarjeeling covers a blend of iconic viewpoints, nature, and cultural experiences. Start early with the Tiger Hill sunrise, where you can witness **Kanchenjunga** in golden light.\n\nYour Darjeeling sightseeing includes the Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park, and [Tenzing Rock](https://indiatour.live/attractions/tenzing-rock-hmi). Enjoy panoramic views from the Darjeeling Ropeway, visit the Tibetan Refugee Self-Help Centre, and take in the beauty of the tea gardens.\n\nYou’ll also visit the Japanese Temple and Peace Pagoda, with evenings free to explore Chowrasta and Mall Road at your own pace.\n\n**Book Your [Gangtok Darjeeling](https://indiatour.live/tours/sikkim-tour-package/enquiry) Trip Now.**\n\n### Why Choose This Gangtok Darjeeling Package\n\n- Offers a **more relaxed pace compared to shorter trips**.\n- Includes **extra time in Gangtok** for deeper exploration.\n- Perfect balance of **sightseeing and leisure time**.\n- Ideal for **couples, families, and first-time travelers**.\n- Multiple stay options available from Basic to Luxury.\n- Private tour ensures comfort, flexibility, and a smooth experience.\n\n### Important Travel Tips for Sikkim Darjeeling Trip\n\n- Carry **warm clothes in all seasons**, especially for early mornings and evenings.\n- Keep valid ID proof handy for permits and hotel check-ins.\n- Start early for sightseeing to avoid weather-related delays.\n- Carry cash for remote areas with limited ATM availability.\n- Stay hydrated and take it slow in high-altitude areas.\n- Pre-book experiences like Nathula Pass for better availability.\n\n**Want a Customized [Sikkim Trip](https://indiatour.live/tours/sikkim-darjeeling-tour-package) Instead.**\n\n👉 **Talk to our travel expert and plan your [Sikkim trip](https://indiatour.live/tours/sikkim-tour-package/enquiry) exactly the way you want.**",
