      "routeSummary": "With Gangtok and Pelling",
      "overviewText": "This **7 Days 6 Nights Sikkim Darjeeling tour package** is a **well-paced Himalayan journey** that covers [Gangtok](https://indiatour.live/attractions/gangtok), Pelling, and [Darjeeling](https://indiatour.live/attractions/darjeeling) in one seamless experience.\n\nYour trip begins with a scenic transfer from Siliguri to Gangtok, where you ease into the mountains before heading out on an excursion to **[Tsomgo Lake](https://indiatour.live/attractions/tsomgo-lake)** and Baba Mandir—one of the most memorable high-altitude experiences in Sikkim.\n\nFrom Gangtok, the journey continues to [Pelling](https://indiatour.live/attractions/pelling) via [Namchi](https://indiatour.live/attractions/namchi), with changing landscapes and quieter surroundings. In Pelling, you explore a mix of monasteries, waterfalls, and viewpoints, along with the popular Skywalk, all set against stunning views of **Kanchenjunga**.\n\nThe trip then moves to Darjeeling, where the vibe shifts to classic hill station charm with tea gardens and colonial-era influences. Your [Darjeeling](https://indiatour.live/attractions/darjeeling) sightseeing includes the iconic Tiger Hill sunrise and visits to key attractions around the town.\n\nOverall, this [Sikkim Darjeeling itinerary](https://indiatour.live/tours/best-of-sikkim-darjeeling-with-kalimpong) is perfect for travelers looking to **experience multiple destinations at a comfortable pace**, with a mix of scenic drives, cultural spots, and iconic Himalayan views.\n\n👉 **[Enquire now](https://indiatour.live/tours/sikkim-tour-package/enquiry) and lock your dates before prices increase.**\n\n### **Sikkim Darjeeling Tour Package** Highlights\n\n#### 🌆 Gangtok\n\nIn Gangtok, you’ll explore the lively MG Marg, known for its cafés, local shops, and relaxed vibe. The highlight of your Gangtok sightseeing is the excursion to **Tsomgo Lake**, a beautiful high-altitude glacial lake surrounded by mountains. The journey continues to Baba Mandir, a revered site dedicated to Baba Harbhajan Singh, before returning to the city by evening.\n\n#### 🏔️ Pelling\n\nYour Pelling experience combines scenic landscapes, cultural sites, and peaceful viewpoints. En route, you’ll visit Namchi, covering Siddheshwar Dham (Char Dham complex) and Sai Temple.\n\nIn Pelling, you’ll explore [Darap Village](https://indiatour.live/attractions/darap-village), Rimbi Waterfalls, [Khecheopalri Lake](https://indiatour.live/attractions/khecheopalri-lake), and Khangchendzonga Waterfalls—offering a mix of nature and local culture. The experience continues with [Pemayangtse Monastery](https://indiatour.live/attractions/pemayangtse-monastery) and [Rabdantse Ruins](https://indiatour.live/attractions/rabdentse-ruins), along with panoramic viewpoints like the Skywalk and Helipad Ground, all set against stunning views of **Kanchenjunga**.\n\n#### 🌄 Darjeeling\n\nDarjeeling covers a blend of iconic viewpoints and cultural attractions. Start early with the Tiger Hill sunrise, where you can witness **Kanchenjunga** in golden light.\n\nYour Darjeeling sightseeing includes the Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park, Tenzing Rock, and the Darjeeling Ropeway for panoramic views. You’ll also visit the Tibetan Refugee Self-Help Centre, Japanese Temple, and [Peace Pagoda](https://indiatour.live/attractions/japanese-peace-pagoda), along with enjoying views of the tea gardens. Evenings are free to explore Chowrasta and Mall Road.\n\n**Book Your [Sikkim Darjeeling Trip Now](https://indiatour.live/tours/best-of-sikkim-darjeeling-with-kalimpong)!**\n\n### Why Choose This Sikkim Darjeeling Package\n\n- Perfect balance of **nature, culture, and relaxation.**\n- Covers top destinations: **[Gangtok](https://indiatour.live/attractions/gangtok), Pelling, and Darjeeling.**\n- Ideal for **couples, families, and first-time Northeast travelers.**\n- Multiple stay options: Basic, Standard, Premium, and Luxury.\n- Private tour ensures flexibility and comfort.\n\n### Important Travel Tips for Sikkim & Darjeeling Trip\n\n- Carry **warm clothes in all seasons**, especially for early mornings and evenings.\n- Keep valid ID proof handy for permits and hotel check-ins.\n- Start sightseeing early to avoid weather disruptions in hilly regions.\n- Carry some cash as ATMs may not be available in remote areas.\n- If you're sensitive to altitude, stay hydrated and avoid rushing your itinerary.\n- Pre-book activities like [Nathula Pass](https://indiatour.live/attractions/nathula-pass) (if you plan to visit).\n\n**Want a Customized [Sikkim Trip](https://indiatour.live/tours/best-of-sikkim-with-gangtok-and-darjeeling) Instead?**\n\n👉 **[Get on a quick call](https://indiatour.live/tours/sikkim-tour-package/enquiry) with our travel expert and plan your Sikkim trip in minutes!**",
